use estimate-template.flow
use estimate-rules.flow
use estimate-draft-rules.flow
use ../knowledge/common-knowledge.flow

do Read the estimate selected by @request or this conversation under
    @draft_rules. Use the explicit project or current checkout and any known
    ticket. Return an object with path, text, project, and ticket_id. as @estimate

do Improve @estimate.text as requested by @request using @estimate_rules and
    @writing_guidance. Preserve layout and unrequested content. Inspect only
    evidence needed by the request. Wording edits must not change scores, scope,
    or SP, or trigger Jira, code investigation, or tests. Do not automatically
    fill an empty template. Return the draft text. as @draft

do Validate changed fields and dependent totals against @estimate_template and
    @estimate_rules. Leave unrelated gaps unchanged and available to report.

do Save and verify @draft at @estimate.path under @draft_rules, using
    @estimate.text as the concurrent-edit baseline.

print Report @estimate.path and any justified SP changes or remaining gaps briefly.
